  "morphology": {
    "compounding_rule": "Gaelic feature-compound ([quality](stem) + element: Dun-derg, red-fort; Ard-mor, great-height) layered over Akkadian construct-chains (Bit-[god], Dur-[ruler], Kar-[god]): the capital Dun-Shinar (Shinar's-fort), Dur-Conn (fort of the Conn-cland), Bit-Tullaru (the temple-city).",
