    },
    "patronymic_form": "the Gaelic ruling clans keep Mac- (son of) / Ua- (descendant of) patronymics and the fine/cland kin-group; the Akkadian populace keep the 'mar-' (son of) patronymic and theophoric constructs; the throne fuses both - a ri who also carries a Bit- house-name over the conquered cities.",
