    "worship_by_alignment": {
      "Chaotic": "Venerates the Chaotic powers of the canon, and names the Lawful powers - and Eternan - as the tyrant-gods to be defied.",
      "Lawful": "venerates the Lawful powers - Eternan foremost, Toran the just, Orlann of the sworn war, Realtan the merciful - and names the Chaotic powers as the fomori (Gaelic demon-host) or -lemnu (Akkadian evil), warded; the war-oath and the law-stele bind alike",
